--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived files
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files were taken from pollen-robotics/microduck and modified for
this standalone crate. Each is marked in its own header as well.

  src/sflp.rs
    Derived from microduck's duck-control/src/imu.rs (SflpDecoder, ImuData,
    half-precision decoding, the quaternion helpers and the median filter).
    Changes: the crate-internal `model::NUM_JOINTS` compile-time assertion was
    dropped, `V2_BOARD_MOUNT` was named from `SflpDecoder::DEFAULT_MOUNT`, and
    the doc comments were rewritten to stand on their own.

  src/stale.rs
    Derived from microduck's duck-control/src/bus.rs (StaleImuTracker) and
    duck-control/src/io.rs (ImuStale). Changes: moved into its own module and
    documented without reference to the Dynamixel bus.

  src/lib.rs
    Derived from microduck's body-imu/src/lib.rs. Changes: the dependency on the
    duck-control crate was removed — the block length and the decoder now come
    from src/sflp.rs — and the `BodyImuIo` integration layer (which needs the
    robot daemon's `RobotIo` trait and the Dynamixel bus) was left behind. The
    register map, the bring-up sequence, `assemble_block`, `MOUNT` and every test
    are the ones developed there.

  src/bin/bench_imu.rs
    Derived from microduck's body-imu/src/bin/bench_body_imu.rs. Changes renamed
    the binary and moved the decoder import into this crate.

  tools/*.py
    Written during the bring-up work in that repository; the files are otherwise
    unchanged apart from having their comments translated to English.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The STMicroelectronics reference driver `imu2uart/Core/Src/lsm6dsv16x.c` from
that repository was NOT copied here, in whole or in part. Its copyright
ownership is undetermined — the repository root declares it Apache-2.0 while the
file header carries a copyright notice — and nothing in this crate needs it: the
register map and the bring-up sequences in src/lib.rs were written from the
datasheet and are pinned by this crate's own tests. Where this crate's behaviour
differs from that reference driver deliberately (the gyroscope full scale, the
SFLP output-data-rate field, the filters), the difference is called out in
src/lib.rs and in docs/design.md.

The mounting calibration in `MOUNT` and the measured numbers quoted in the
documentation were measured on the authors' hardware, independently of that
repository.